<p>If you self-host Retool, refer to the <a class="" href="/self-hosted/self-managed/reference/egress">self-hosted network and storage requirements</a> for additional details.</p></div><footer class="theme-doc-footer docusaurus-mt-lg"><aside><p class="text--right">Need more help?<!-- --> <a href="https://community.retool.com/new-topic?category=undefined&amp;body=%0A%0A%20%3E%20%5BRetool%20IP%20addresses%5D(https://docs.retool.com/data-sources/reference/ip-allowlist-cloud-orgs)&amp;source=docs" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="help-link">Ask Retool developers</a></p></aside></footer></article></div></div><div class="col col--3"><div class="tableOfContents_jeP5 thin-scrollbar theme-doc-toc-desktop"><div class="feedback-toc margin-top--md"><div class="feedback-toc__widget"><span class="feedback-toc__prompt">Was this page helpful?</span><div class="feedback-toc__choices"><button type="button" class="feedback-toc__choice"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" class="feedback-toc__choice-icon" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M234,80.12A24,24,0,0,0,216,72H160V56a40,40,0,0,0-40-40,8,8,0,0,0-7.16,4.42L75.06,96H32a16,16,0,0,0-16,16v88a16,16,0,0,0,16,16H204a24,24,0,0,0,23.82-21l12-96A24,24,0,0,0,234,80.12ZM32,112H72v88H32ZM223.94,97l-12,96a8,8,0,0,1-7.94,7H88V105.89l36.71-73.43A24,24,0,0,1,144,56V80a8,8,0,0,0,8,8h64a8,8,0,0,1,7.94,9Z"></path></svg>Yes</button><button type="button" class="feedback-toc__choice"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" class="feedback-toc__choice-icon" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M239.82,157l-12-96A24,24,0,0,0,204,40H32A16,16,0,0,0,16,56v88a16,16,0,0,0,16,16H75.06l37.78,75.58A8,8,0,0,0,120,240a40,40,0,0,0,40-40V184h56a24,24,0,0,0,23.82-27ZM72,144H32V56H72Zm150,21.29a7.88,7.88,0,0,1-6,2.71H152a8,8,0,0,0-8,8v24a24,24,0,0,1-19.29,23.54L88,150.11V56H204a8,8,0,0,1,7.94,7l12,96A7.87,7.87,0,0,1,222,165.29Z"><